  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deir Ali, Energy Station Rehab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enhance resilience and recovery in Syria. This will be achieved through ensuring a stable and reliable supply of electricity to the national grid which will enable sustainable development, strengthen public service delivery, and improve living conditions for millions of people by providing and installing urgently required replacement spare parts to ensure proper operation and maintenance of Extension 2 of the Deir Ali power plant.</narrative>
  </description>
